# UI Prompt Preload

When creating or modifying Unity UI scripts, read these first:

- `docs/version_02/prompt_ui_system.md`
- `docs/version_02/prompt_main_scene_ui.md`
- `docs/version_02/ui_architecture_workflow.md`
- `docs/version_02/prompt_ui_tech_wasteland_visual_design.md`

Apply the MainScene UI pattern for page scripts:

- Reserve Inspector fields for `Image`, `TMP_Text`, `Slider`, `Button`, `Canvas`, and related Unity UI controls.
- Keep page scripts as Presenters: refresh display, red dots, and button callbacks only.
- Do not implement Icon Buttons as plain generated text; bind `Button + Image + TMP_Text + redDot`.
